 "title": "Gene Annotation and Protein Analysis Tools and Databases",
 "summary": "This cluster is centered around various gene annotation and protein analysis tools and databases. AnnoPRO uses several tools, including CAFA4, DeepGOPlus, NetGO3, PFmulDL, and StringTie2, which is faster and more accurate than FLAIR and Scallop. The cluster also includes several gene and protein databases, such as UniProt, UniProtKB, and OrthoDB, which is used by BUSCO and has orthologs with UniProt. Additionally, the cluster contains several organisms, including F. yunnanensis, which has a strain Z68, and Homo sapiens, which has orthologs with Drosophila melanogaster.",
